{"unit_id":"lihang-lh__dsh-task-panel#card-1","repo":"lihang-lh/dsh-task-panel","commit":"7c0c3d8aff808488735b318578221b94cde9ef8a","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-task-panel（DSH Web 插件）：把任务发布、执行和验收集中到一个侧边面板。插件在侧边栏底部添加入口，并打开可调整宽度的任务抽屉；任务可自动关联相关历史会话，随后由子代理按规划、开发和复核阶段推进，需求不清时可先向用户提问。面板支持查看状态与进度、确认计划、暂停或恢复任务、编辑和重新执行，并展示复核问题与截图。适合希望把开发工作拆成可跟踪任务并由子代理协作处理的 DSH Web 用户。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:72-90","client.js:1094-1104"]}
{"unit_id":"lihang-lh__dsh-task-panel#card-2","repo":"lihang-lh/dsh-task-panel","commit":"7c0c3d8aff808488735b318578221b94cde9ef8a","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-task-panel (DSH Web plugin) provides a sidebar for publishing and tracking tasks. Subagents can plan, develop, and review each task in stages, asking for clarification when needed. Users can link past sessions, monitor progress, pause or resume work, and view review issues and screenshots.","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:593-675","index.js:704-730","client.js:1094-1104"]}
