{"unit_id":"lihang-lh__dsh-task-panel#feature-1","repo":"lihang-lh/dsh-task-panel","commit":"7c0c3d8aff808488735b318578221b94cde9ef8a","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-task-panel 的功能「任务流水线」：从面板发布任务后，Host 可调度子代理先规划，再进入开发和自动复核；复核有遗留问题时会退回开发重试。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:593-675","index.js:704-730"]}
{"unit_id":"lihang-lh__dsh-task-panel#feature-2","repo":"lihang-lh/dsh-task-panel","commit":"7c0c3d8aff808488735b318578221b94cde9ef8a","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-task-panel 的功能「历史会话关联」：发布任务时按标题和描述搜索历史会话并关联候选，面板也可先扫描候选供选择。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:297-318","index.js:871-875","index.js:908-918"]}
{"unit_id":"lihang-lh__dsh-task-panel#feature-3","repo":"lihang-lh/dsh-task-panel","commit":"7c0c3d8aff808488735b318578221b94cde9ef8a","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-task-panel 的功能「澄清需求」：规划代理提出问题后，任务进入待澄清；用户回答至少一个问题后，插件再次生成定稿计划。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:605-613","index.js:624-645","index.js:934-953"]}
{"unit_id":"lihang-lh__dsh-task-panel#feature-4","repo":"lihang-lh/dsh-task-panel","commit":"7c0c3d8aff808488735b318578221b94cde9ef8a","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-task-panel 的功能「任务状态控制」：面板可确认计划、暂停或恢复任务、打回开发、重新执行、编辑或验收，并展示各阶段状态。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:923-1068","client.js:1004-1047"]}
{"unit_id":"lihang-lh__dsh-task-panel#caveat-1","repo":"lihang-lh/dsh-task-panel","commit":"7c0c3d8aff808488735b318578221b94cde9ef8a","type":"caveat","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-task-panel 的历史会话关联依赖 DSH 的 sessionQuery.searchSessions；搜索接口不可用或搜索被关闭时，插件捕获错误并返回空候选，自动关联与扫描将无法提供结果。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:297-305"]}
